email.body:
Hi {Owner},

I build websites for urgent care and walk-in clinic groups around {City}. {Business Name} has good reviews, but the site doesn't show a wait time, has no online check-in and lists every clinic's hours in one block.

I built a sample first rather than ask for a meeting: live waits by clinic, online check-in with a text when it's nearly their turn, an open-now finder, services by clinic, self-pay prices and an employer page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If it's useful, I finish it in phases for {Build Range}, connected to the queue system you already use, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and updates. Your medical director approves every page before it publishes.

Worth twenty minutes this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
